{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_59","type":"agent_message","text":"The standalone browser checks now pass for keyboard/mouse, a standard gamepad stub, remapping and glyphs, touch movement plus firing, the editor, attract timing, and offline boot in Chromium and WebKit. Two-player online play has also completed the full campaign under simulated latency and loss. The dedicated-server campaign check is still running.\n"}}
