{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_66","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '7775,7787p' Yars-*/vendor/engine/my-3d2dge.js && rg -n 'advance\\\\(\\\\{n|remapping captures|route real|replay resets|No runtime' Yars-*/tests/browser.py && ls -l Yars-*/tests/artifacts/hub-campaign-*\"","aggregated_output":"  /** true once the browser lets the game make sound */\n  get ready() { return !!this.ctx && this.ctx.state === 'running'; }\n  /** apply volume, musicVolume, sfxVolume and mute after setting them directly (setVolume and mute call it) */\n  applyVolume() { if (!this.ctx) return; this._master.gain.value = this.muted ? 0 : this.volume; this._sfxBus.gain.value = this.sfxVolume; this._musBus.gain.value = this.musicVolume * (this._ducked || this.ducked ? .35 : 1); this._voiceBus.gain.value = this.voiceVolume; }\n  /** a bus for a sound of the game's own (Web Audio nodes it makes on audio.ctx: a babble voice, a loop, an instrument)\n   *  to connect to, so it follows the volume, the mute and the player's settings: 'sfx', 'music', 'voice' (its level is\n   *  voiceVolume) or 'master'. Returns a GainNode, or null where there is no sound (headless, no Web Audio) */\n  bus(name = 'sfx') {\n    if (!['sfx', 'music', 'voice', 'master'].includes(name)) warn('bus:' + name, 'audio.bus(\"' + name + '\"): no such bus (sfx, music, voice, master): the sfx bus');\n    if (this._game.headless || !this._init()) return null;\n    return name === 'master' ? this._master : name === 'music' ? this._musBus : name === 'voice' ? this._voiceBus : this._sfxBus;\n  }\n  /** set the master volume, 0..1 */\n15:def advance(n=.05):return ev(f'__game.advance({n},{{draw:true}}); __game.debug.snapshot()')\n55:    check('native remapping captures a real replacement key',lambda:ev('__game.input.map.fire.includes(\"KeyF\")'))\n63:    check('master music effects and voice settings route real buses',lambda:ev('Math.abs(__game.audio.bus(\"voice\").gain.value-.24)<.001 && Math.abs(__game.audio.bus(\"sfx\").gain.value-.31)<.001 && Math [... omitted end of long line]\n86:    check('campaign replay resets presentation event namespace',lambda:ev('!RuinApp.presentationDebug().sound.disposed && RuinApp.presentationDebug().visuals.seen<20'))\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 21848 Nov  6 02:52 Yars-of-Ruin-Yars-Revenge-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022904/tests/artifacts/hub-campaign-server.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 10146 Nov  6 02:46 Yars-of-Ruin-Yars-Revenge-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022904/tests/artifacts/hub-campaign-standard.json\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_67","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\np='Yars-of-Ruin-Yars-Revenge-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022904/src/main.js'\ns=open(p).read();a=s.index('function howto(');b=s.index('function about(',a)\ns=s[:a]+'''function howto(page=0){const lessons=[['Open a path','Hold primary fire to chip shield cells. Fly into a cell to bite it safely. Bites score more and fill your cannon charge. Five bites ready a shot.'],['Call the siege gun','Align your scout with the heart. Call the gun on the left rail, then move vertically out of its lane. The enormous projectile can kill either scout. A blocked shot is spent. Diamond cells reflect it once.'],['Trust the static, carefully','The bright band blocks guided threats, but disables both weapons. It never blocks a Swirl or your cannon. Top and bottom edges connect. The fortress itself becomes the Swirl; its warning shows the committed route.'],['Break the last heart','Primary fire cannot hurt the heart. A cannon interception earns a replacement scout. Brush its green docked heart for renewable charge. The final heart must be shot in flight. No cells left? Its dock always returns.']];ui.show('help'+page,{kicker:'Field transmission '+(page+1)+' / 4',title:lessons[page][0],text:lessons[page][1],keys:page===0?[[glyph()?'Left stick':'WASD / arrows','Fly'],[glyph()?'Right stick':'Mouse / movement','Aim'],[controls.label('fire'),'Primary shot']]:page===1?[[controls.label('cannon'),'Call siege cannon'],[game.input.label('pause'),'Pause / back']]:undefined,actions:[...(page<3?[[\\\"Next transmission  →\\\",()=>howto(page+1)]]:[]),['Back',()=>ui.back()]]});}\n''' +s[b:]\na=s.index('function about(');b=s.index('function dev(',a)\ns=s[:a]+'''function about(page=0){const info=Object.entries(report.sourceInformation||{}).map(([k,v])=>[k[0].toUpperCase()+k.slice(1),v]),tests=(report.testingFeedback||[]).map((v,i)=>[['Issues found','Critical issues','Most helpful test','Least helpful test'][i],v]),engine=(report.engineFeedback||[]).map((v,i)=>[['Liked most','Got stuck / guessed wrong','Built ourselves','Hardest part','Engine changes','One improvement'][i],v]),prompt=(report.promptFeedback||[]).map((v,i)=>[['Liked most','Confusing','Hardest task','Suggested change'][i],v]);const pages=[['Source Information · 1 / 3',info.slice(0,5)],['Source Information · 2 / 3',info.slice(5,10)],['Source Information · 3 / 3',info.slice(10)],['Testing Feedback',tests],['Engine Feedback · 1 / 2',engine.slice(0,3)],['Engine Feedback · 2 / 2',engine.slice(3)],['Prompt Feedback',prompt]];ui.show('about'+page,{kicker:'Yars of Ruin · credits '+(page+1)+' / '+pages.length,title:pages[page][0],sections:pages[page][1],text:page===0?'Original game: Howard Scott Warshaw / Atari, 1982. An original adaptation; no recorded audio or external art.':undefined,actions:[...(page<pages.length-1?[[pages[page+1][0]+'  →',()=>about(page+1)]]:[]),['Back',()=>ui.back()]]});}\n''' +s[b:]\ns=s.replace(\\\"screens:{pause:{kicker:'Transmission held',title:'Fold your wings'},help:{title:'How to Play'} }\\\", \\\"screens:{pause:{kicker:'Transmission held',title:'Fold your wings'}}\\\")\ns=s.replace(\\\".textContent=sectorName(world.sector)\\\", \\\".textContent=world.customContent?.name||sectorName(world.sector)\\\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='Yars-of-Ruin-Yars-Revenge-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022904/tests/browser.py'\ns=open(p).read().replace('gain.value-.23*.32','gain.value-.23*.35')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\nnode --check Yars-of-Ruin-Yars-Revenge-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022904/src/main.js\nnode Yars-of-Ruin-Yars-Revenge-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022904/tools/build.mjs\n/home/micha/.local/share/pipx/venvs/playwright/bin/python Yars-of-Ruin-Yars-Revenge-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022904/tests/browser.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
