{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_75","type":"agent_message","text":"Replay checks found a presentation bug: event IDs restarted each campaign, so later runs could lose effects and sounds. I’ve fixed that cleanup. I also split the instructions and credits into pages readable on a controller, and am now capturing the final packaged campaign and ending while checking replay, records, and pause-menu joining.\n"}}
