{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_99","type":"agent_message","text":"The combined run ended with two failed campaign checks: both scripted teams exhausted their reserves. The bot made decisions more often than its controls were transmitted, so its fire-and-evade timing drifted. I’m moving those test decisions to the transmission boundary and rerunning them with the same combat rules and resources.\n"}}
