{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_107","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('../PROGRESS.md');s=p.read_text().replace('standalone browser: 55 passed.','standalone browser: 56 passed.').replace('online mocks: 13 passed','online mocks: 14 passed').replace('12 distinct defects found and fixed','13 distinct defects found and fixed');a=s.index('## Active final gate');b=s.index('## Ownership',a);s=s[:a]+'''## Active final gate\nThe first combined release run ended **167 passed, 6 failed**: both scripted online teams legitimately lost their campaigns. Rules, runtime/lifecycle/protocol, standalone and authoring checks all passed; failures were full-play outcome assertions. Investigation found the stateful test pilot advanced its fire/evade memory at render cadence while controls were sent at 10 Hz. This did not match its passing sampled-input Node proof.\n\nOnline agent added optional remote-only \"'`setInputSource(fn)`, sampled exactly at the real packet boundary. It traverses the same action-edge queue and host validation, does not grant gameplay state, and is cleared on end. Default null leaves normal device controls unchanged. A new mock checks cadence/countdown/cleanup (14 mocks now pass). Hub browser campaigns now call this source for remote pilots; host-local pilot runs at normal fixed steps. Root fixed per-scout co-op prompts and added a real P2 L2 HUD assertion; **56 standalone browser checks pass**. Feedback/interview report **13 fixed defects, 3 critical**.\n\nThe root artifact was rebuilt with the packet-boundary source hook and final HUD/report. Agent `/root/online` is running `--campaign-only` now. Wait for both full campaigns to win; fix only the test controller if necessary without grants. Then run final `npm test` from dev folder (expected 175 checks), inspect exact result, and record it here/docs. Verify identical HTML copies and JSON parsing. No further product changes are planned.\n\n'\"''' +s[b:];p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat tests/artifacts/test-summary.json | head -6\nrg -c 'setInputSource' ../Yars-of-Ruin-Yars-Revenge-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022904.html\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
