ed.\n\n'\"''' +s[b:];p.write_text(s)\nPY\ncat tests/artifacts/test-summary.json | head -6\nrg -c 'setInputSource' ../Yars-of-Ruin-Yars-Revenge-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022904.html\"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"group\": \"all\",\n  \"passed\": 167,\n  \"failed\": 6,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n2\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
