{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_111","type":"agent_message","text":"Both campaign checks now pass with decisions made at transmission time: two-player co-op under latency and loss, and a solo campaign on the hidden dedicated server. I also strengthened the editor check to verify that removing a cell actually changes the layout before export and replay. I’m running the full suite once more on the final artifact.\n"}}
